  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of DevOp.ZoHo.Desk.\n      - Full fluent query builders for Tickets, Accounts, Contacts, Articles, Contracts, SupportPlans, Agents, Teams, and Departments\n      - Auto-paginating ToListAsync() and IAsyncEnumerable Paged() on all query builders\n      - Rich ticket search (GET /tickets/search) with 20+ filters, wildcards, date ranges, and custom fields\n      - Cross-module search and per-module typed searches\n      - Agent time entries, signatures, and customized signature support\n      - ILogger<T> structured logging on all resources\n      - ZoHo OAuth 2.0 token management via DevOp.ZoHo.Auth",
